{"kind":"text","seq":5,"text":"**Blackwyrm's Seven Coils** — track black, rails bright green, supports dark green.\n\nThe name comes from the ride's silhouette: one immense 60-ft-drop spine that then knots itself into seven inversions — two vertical loops and five corkscrew pairs — like a serpent coiling on itself; the black spine with venom-green rails gives it the adder's markings, while dark green supports sink into the hillside so the wyrm appears to hang unsupported over the park."}
